<title>CANADA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM CANADIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM CANADIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Canadian Open</p>
<p>tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>1-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) beat 2-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 7-5 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-1</p>
<p>3-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Nathalie Dechy (France)</p>
<p>4-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-2 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6)</p>
<p>5-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Anne Miller (U.S.) 6-2</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>10-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Nicole Arendt (U.S.) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>11-Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>15-Sandrine Testud (France) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Rita Grande (Italy) beat Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand) 6-4</p>
<p>2-6 6-4</p>
<p>Magui Serna (Spain) beat Miho Saeki (Japan) 7-6 (9-7) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Francesca Lubiani (Italy)</p>
<p>6-7 (0-7) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Francesca Lubiani (Italy) beat Tatiana Panova (Russia) 6-2</p>
<p>7-6 (7-1)</p>
